  "contracts": [
    "Append preserves the input route, registry, accepted trajectories, and current preview.",
    "Repeat counts are integers from 1 to 16; the full route including bridges is limited to 128 sets.",
    "Missing transitions reject append instead of creating new motion. A separate explicit registration step prepares a new transition.",
    "The selected source is joined through registered physical ports only, with no arm search or avatar validation during append.",
    "UI previews added bridge/source sets and a possible return path with movement and ball-identity periods.",
    "A generated transition purpose is display metadata, persists through save/restore, and does not bypass source validation.",
    "Older documents without transition-purpose metadata still import and show all their sources."
  ],
